processData(\"test\")\n}\n", "tool_call_id": "call_43070a7638d5"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Now I'll make the requested changes and save the file.\n\n<tool_call>\nname: write_file\narguments: {\"path\": \"handler.go\", \"contents\": \"package main\\n\\nimport \\\"fmt\\\"\\n\\nfunc processData(data string) error {\\n\\tif data == \\\"\\\" {\\n\\t\\treturn fmt.Errorf(\\\"data cannot be empty\\\")\\n\\t}\\n\\tfmt.Println(\\\"Processing:\\\", data)\\n\\treturn nil\\n}\\n\\nfunc main() {\\n\\tif err := processData(\\\"test\\\"); err != nil {\\n\\t\\tfmt.Println(\\\"Error:\\\", err)\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\"}\n</tool_call>"}, {"role": "tool", "content": "File written successfully.", "tool_call_id": "call_3f3235509b56"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}]}
