eded\"\n\tresult := sprintf(\"Task %s did not succeed\", [task.name])\n}\n", "tool_call_id": "call_07a5f1976587"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Now I'll make the requested changes and save the file.\n\n<tool_call>\nname: write_file\narguments: {\"path\": \"policy.rego\", \"contents\": \"package example\\n\\nimport rego.v1\\n\\ndeny contains result if {\\n\\tsome task in input.tasks\\n\\ttask.status != \\\"Succeeded\\\"\\n\\tnot task.status == \\\"Skipped\\\"\\n\\tresult := sprintf(\\\"Task %s did not succeed\\\", [task.name])\\n}\\n\"}\n</tool_call>"}, {"role": "tool", "content": "File written successfully.", "tool_call_id": "call_935b5145400f"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}]}
