ant", "content": "Now I'll make the requested changes and save the file.\n\n<tool_call>\nname: write_file\narguments: {\"path\": \"docs.md\", \"contents\": \"# Example\\n\\nHere's some code:\\n\\n```python\\ndef hello(name=\\\"World\\\"):\\n    print(f\\\"Hello, {name}\\\")\\n```\\n\"}\n</tool_call>"}, {"role": "tool", "content": "File written successfully.", "tool_call_id": "call_51bd560d70f5"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Done."}]}
